  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai steamed fish serves 4 and takes about 30 minutes. A whole white fish (use 1 whole sea bass or snapper, approximately 700 g, no slug, described as "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "white fish fillet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "white-fish-fillet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in the ingredient list as a stand-in) is steamed over a lime and chilli broth flavoured with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "lemongrass",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lemongrass"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fish sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fresh coriander",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coriander-fresh"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and lime finish the dish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Score the fish three times on each side before steaming. This helps the broth penetrate the flesh and ensures even cooking all the way to the bone."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
